0jcrA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jql4x80jcrA", "title": "Stones Keeper Director's Cut - Official 2.0 Release Date Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jql4x80jcrA/fhddefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 11246, "name": "Stones Keeper"}]}